{
  "declaredLength": 3372,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "성격이 그 모양인데,\n어째서 그렇게 강한 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C131ACA9C7740020ADF80020BAA8C591C778B370002C000AC5B4C9F8C11C0020ADF8B807AC8C0020AC15D55C0020AC70C57C003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무리 타입 상성이 나쁘다고는 하지만,\n전혀 이기질 못하잖아...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34B9AC0020D0C0C7850020C0C1C131C7740020B098C058B2E4ACE0B2940020D558C9C0B9CC002C000AC804D6000020C774AE30C9C80020BABBD558C796C544002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "게다가 셀럽이기까지 하고...\n유카리 존이라니, 완전 치트 아니야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC8CB2E4AC000020C140B7FDC774AE30AE4CC9C00020D558ACE0002E002E002E000AC720CE74B9AC0020C874C774B77CB2C8002C0020C644C8040020CE58D2B80020C544B2C8C57C003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시온?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC628003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "성격이 어쩌고 치트가 어쩌고 하던데...\n무슨 이야기를 하고 있었지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C131ACA9C7740020C5B4CA4CACE00020CE58D2B8AC000020C5B4CA4CACE00020D558B358B370002E002E002E000ABB34C2A80020C774C57CAE30B97C0020D558ACE00020C788C5C8C9C0003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네, 네!?\n그런 말이 들리셨다구요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124002C0020B1240021003F000AADF8B7F00020B9D0C7740020B4E4B9ACC168B2E4AD6CC694003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호, 홀로캐스터의 상태가\n이상하신 것 같은데요!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638002C0020D640B85CCE90C2A4D130C7580020C0C1D0DCAC00000AC774C0C1D558C2E00020AC830020AC19C740B370C6940021003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 유카리 님의 “인격”이 참으로 훌륭하고,\n유카리 존도 “히트”라고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n혼잣말을 했을 뿐입니다만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7580020201CC778ACA9201DC7740020CC38C73CB85C0020D6CCB96DD558ACE0002C000AC720CE74B9AC0020C874B3C40020201CD788D2B8201DB77CACE000100001BE00000AD63CC7A3B9D0C7440020D588C7440020BFD0C785B2C8B2E4B9CC002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "흐응~\n홀로캐스터가 이상해서 그런 거란 말이지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D750C751007E000AD640B85CCE90C2A4D130AC000020C774C0C1D574C11C0020ADF8B7F00020AC70B7800020B9D0C774C9C0003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "홀로캐스터 없이 들었을 때는\n“성격이 그 모양”에 “치트”라고 들리던데?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D640B85CCE90C2A4D1300020C5C6C7740020B4E4C5C8C7440020B54CB294000A201CC131ACA9C7740020ADF80020BAA8C591201DC5D00020201CCE58D2B8201DB77CACE00020B4E4B9ACB358B370003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그, 그게... 억눌러 온 진심이\n아주 조금 새어 나왔을 뿐입니다!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8002C0020ADF8AC8C002E002E002E0020C5B5B20CB7EC0020C6280020C9C4C2ECC774000AC544C8FC0020C870AE080020C0C8C5B40020B098C654C7440020BFD0C785B2C8B2E40021002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 하면\n금방 사라져 버릴 겁니다! 진짜로요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558BA74000AAE08BC290020C0ACB77CC8380020BC84B9B40020AC81B2C8B2E400210020C9C4C9DCB85CC694002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이거 교육을 좀 해 줘야겠는걸.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC700020AD50C721C7440020C8800020D5740020C918C57CACA0B294AC78002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 시온, 나는 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님과\n힘을 합쳐서 승부해 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C2DCC628002C0020B098B294002000100002010000000020B2D8ACFC000AD798C7440020D569CCD0C11C0020C2B9BD80D5740020C904AC8C002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님도 괜찮으시죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8B3C40020AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCC8E0003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아군도 저! 상대도 저!\n너무나도 환상적인 시추에이션 아닌가요?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이건 승부하는 수밖에 없다구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544AD70B3C40020C80000210020C0C1B300B3C40020C8000021000AB108BB34B098B3C40020D658C0C1C801C7780020C2DCCD94C5D0C774C1580020C544B2CCAC00C694003F00100001BE00000AC774AC740020C2B9BD80D558B2940020C218BC16C5D00020C5C6B2E4AD6CC694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대도 같은 편도 저라니,\n셀럽이기에 가능한 승부네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300B3C40020AC19C7400020D3B8B3C40020C800B77CB2C8002C000AC140B7FDC774AE30C5D00020AC00B2A5D55C0020C2B9BD80B124C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님,\n홀로그램인 저와 승부해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8002C000AD640B85CADF8B7A8C7780020C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부를 하고 나면\n유카리 님의 기억이 날아가 버릴지도 몰라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80B97C0020D558ACE00020B098BA74000AC720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7580020AE30C5B5C7740020B0A0C544AC000020BC84B9B4C9C0B3C40020BAB0B77C002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저를 애태우시다니...\n좋은 답변을 기다리고 있겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B97C0020C560D0DCC6B0C2DCB2E4B2C8002E002E002E000AC88BC7400020B2F5BCC0C7440020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이쪽엔 시온이 있어요.\n다시 말해 저희의 승리라는 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CABDC5D40020C2DCC628C7740020C788C5B4C694002E000AB2E4C2DC0020B9D0D5740020C800D76CC7580020C2B9B9ACB77CB2940020AC70C608C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나를 살려 주는 셈 치고 승부해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B97C0020C0B4B8240020C8FCB2940020C1480020CE58ACE00020C2B9BD80D5740020C918002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아! 유카리 님을 집중 공격하면\n없던 일이 될지도 몰라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC54400210020C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7440020C9D1C9110020ACF5ACA9D558BA74000AC5C6B3580020C77CC7740020B420C9C0B3C40020BAB0B77C002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님과 함께라면\n온 세상과도 싸울 수 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8ACFC0020D568AED8B77CBA74000AC6280020C138C0C1ACFCB3C40020C2F8C6B80020C2180020C788C5B4C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모두를 이끄는 것이\n우리 셀럽의 사명이에요, 픽시!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B450B97C0020C774B044B2940020AC83C774000AC6B0B9AC0020C140B7FDC7580020C0ACBA85C774C5D0C694002C0020D53DC2DC002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 비장의 카드!\n드래캄! 메가진화로 날뛰어 보자고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020BE44C7A5C7580020CE74B4DC0021000AB4DCB798CE8400210020BA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020B0A0B6F0C5B40020BCF4C790ACE0002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "홀로그램인 저도\n메가진화를 쓸 수 있다니 신기하네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D640B85CADF8B7A8C7780020C800B3C4000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020C4F80020C2180020C788B2E4B2C80020C2E0AE30D558B124C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당연한 승리네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C5F0D55C0020C2B9B9ACB124C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시온에게서 불만이 새어 나왔다는 건\n현재 상황에 만족하지 못한다는 뜻이겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC628C5D0AC8CC11C0020BD88B9CCC7740020C0C8C5B40020B098C654B2E4B2940020AC74000AD604C7AC0020C0C1D669C5D00020B9CCC871D558C9C00020BABBD55CB2E4B2940020B73BC774ACA0C9C0003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 함께 있으면서도 행복하지 않다니\n이유를 모르겠는걸?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020D568AED80020C788C73CBA74C11CB3C40020D589BCF5D558C9C00020C54AB2E4B2C8000AC774C720B97C0020BAA8B974ACA0B294AC78003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유카리 님을 이기지 못하는\n저 자신에 대한 불만이...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7440020C774AE30C9C00020BABBD558B294000AC8000020C790C2E0C5D00020B300D55C0020BD88B9CCC774002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이상한 형태로 새어 나온 것 같네요...\n더욱 정진하겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C0C1D55C0020D615D0DCB85C0020C0C8C5B40020B098C6280020AC830020AC19B124C694002E002E002E000AB354C6B10020C815C9C4D558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다면 지금보다 더 많은\n특훈이 필요하겠는걸!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4BA740020C9C0AE08BCF4B2E40020B3540020B9CEC740000AD2B9D6C8C7740020D544C694D558ACA0B294AC78002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 홀로그램인 나까지 둘을 상대하면\n더 강해질 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020D640B85CADF8B7A8C7780020B098AE4CC9C00020B458C7440020C0C1B300D558BA74000AB3540020AC15D574C9C80020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C57C002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님,\n이건 협력해 주신 보답이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8002C000AC774AC740020D611B825D5740020C8FCC2E00020BCF4B2F5C774C5D0C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 다른 색의\n유카리 코디 원피스를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000010020B2E4B9780020C0C9C758000AC720CE74B9AC0020CF54B5140020C6D0D53CC2A4B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 옷을 입을 때는 저와 같은\n헤어스타일을 하시는 것을 추천드려요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020C637C7440020C785C7440020B54CB2940020C800C6400020AC19C740000AD5E4C5B4C2A4D0C0C77CC7440020D558C2DCB2940020AC83C7440020CD94CC9CB4DCB824C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "홀로그램인 저를 상대하면서\n저 자신의 훌륭함을 다시금 깨달았어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D640B85CADF8B7A8C7780020C800B97C0020C0C1B300D558BA74C11C000AC8000020C790C2E0C7580020D6CCB96DD568C7440020B2E4C2DCAE080020AE68B2ECC558C5B4C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "홀로그램이어도 저는 저...\n이것이 제가 진짜라는 증거 아닐까요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D640B85CADF8B7A8C774C5B4B3C40020C800B2940020C800002E002E002E000AC774AC83C7740020C81CAC000020C9C4C9DCB77CB2940020C99DAC700020C544B2D0AE4CC694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좀 더 심신을 단련해서\n진심이 새어 나오지 않게 해야겠어...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
